{"attack":"用强风吹开对手的反射壁或光墙等。也会降低对手的闪避率。","description":"令目标的闪避率降低1级。清除场上的起雾天气。\n只要此招式成功使出，无论是否降低了目标的闪避率，都会移除目标场地上的白雾、光墙、反射壁、极光幕和神秘守护，移除双方场地上入场可生效的状态和场地型状态。\n如果目标处于替身状态，则虽然闪避率不会降低，但后续效果仍然发生。\n清除浓雾一定会命中，除非目标正在使用蓄力的招式并不在场地上。\n如果对手被白雾保护，则对手闪避率不会降低，但白雾随之被清除。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Farfetchd form:galarian","Level":35},{"Name":"Weezing form:galarian","Level":0},{"Name":"Hoothoot","Level":15},{"Name":"Giratina form:altered","Level":0},{"Name":"Giratina form:origin","Level":0},{"Name":"Lilligant form:hisuian","Level":0},{"Name":"Ducklett","Level":6},{"Name":"Swanna","Level":0},{"Name":"Rufflet","Level":60},{"Name":"Braviary","Level":64},{"Name":"Braviary form:hisuian","Level":64},{"Name":"Vullaby","Level":60},{"Name":"Mandibuzz","Level":64},{"Name":"TapuFini","Level":30},{"Name":"Kartana","Level":50},{"Name":"Sirfetchd","Level":35},{"Name":"Frosmoth","Level":16}],"tutorMoves":["Beedrill","Pidgey","Pidgeotto","Pidgeot","Spearow","Fearow","Venomoth","Ledian","Yanma","Murkrow","Gligar","Beautifly","Dustox","Taillow","Swellow","Masquerain","Volbeat","Illumise","Castform","Tropius","Chimecho","Piplup","Prinplup","Empoleon","Starly","Staravia","Staraptor","Mothim","Honchkrow","Chatot","Carnivine","Finneon","Lumineon","Yanmega","Gliscor","Arceus","Arceus form:grass","Arceus form:fire","Arceus form:water","Arceus form:flying","Arceus form:bug","Arceus form:poison","Arceus form:electric","Arceus form:psychic","Arceus form:rock","Arceus form:ground","Arceus form:dark","Arceus form:ghost","Arceus form:steel","Arceus form:fighting","Arceus form:ice","Arceus form:dragon","Arceus form:fairy","Snivy","Servine","Serperior","Ducklett","Swanna","Vivillon","Florges","Pikipek","Trumbeak","Toucannon","Oricorio form:baile","Oricorio form:pompom","Oricorio form:pau","Oricorio form:sensu"],"eggMoves":["Pidgey","Pidgeotto","Pidgeot","Zubat","Golbat","Scyther","Crobat","Scizor","Seedot","Nuzleaf","Shiftry","Taillow","Swellow","Swablu","Altaria","Drifloon","Drifblim","Chatot","Pidove","Tranquill","U